LOCUS       HIV1_HXB2_provirus      9719 bp    DNA     linear   VRL 14-APR-2026
DEFINITION  Human immunodeficiency virus type 1 (HXB2) integrated provirus,
            complete annotated genome; HIV1/HTLV-III/LAV reference.
ACCESSION   K03455
VERSION     K03455.1
KEYWORDS    .
SOURCE      .
  ORGANISM  Human immunodeficiency virus 1
            Viruses; Riboviria; Pararnavirae; Artverviricota; Revtraviricetes;
            Ortervirales; Retroviridae; Orthoretrovirinae; Lentivirus.
COMMENT     Integrated proviral dsDNA form of HIV-1 HXB2 as found after
            integration into the human genome (e.g. in T cells). Sequence
            source: GenBank K03455.1. Annotation includes all major ORFs, LTR
            subregions (U3/R/U5), regulatory elements (TATA box, NF-kB sites,
            TAR, PBS, Psi, PPT, cPPT, RRE, poly-A signal), splice sites, and
            processed peptide boundaries. Coordinates follow standard HXB2
            numbering (LANL HIV Database). Annotated by Biomni/Phylo 2026-04-14.
